lldata. One-time fee, AES-256-GCM + ML-KEM-768 encryption, MonadVault app.\n\n📚 TECHNICAL DOSSIERS\nEvery product above has its own technical dossier: contracts, specs and how it is tested. The Website button opens the hub with all of them. Docs opens the $WRAITH dossier.\n\n📄 CA (Monad): 0x7E8BDf7D262a6e4ff9302Af49F2CdB022B587777\nSupply: 1,000,000,000 · 18 decimals\nAlways check the CA. Anything else calling itself $WRAITH is not it.\n\nBuybacks are a mechanism, not a promise about price. Nothing here is investment advice.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://dagentx.com"},{"label":"Docs","url":"https://dagentx.com/wraith-token"},{"label":"WRAITH Wallet","url":"https://wallet.dagentx.com"},{"label":"wraithwallet.net","url":"https://wraithwallet.net"},{"label":"Google Play","url":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dagentx.wraith"},{"label":"Tech Dossier","url":"https://dagentx.com/wraith"},{"label":"DropClaw","url":"https://dropclaw.cloud"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/WraithOnX_"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/7wbt7ant1dbze3wpbpqruhvo4x7y95pbhnbmvablpump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"7wBt7aNt1DBzE3WPbPQruhvo4x7Y95PBHnBMVaBLpump","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/mcK6NTUT3bdZjPoX?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/JSJhfhIUa9hCT6oD?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/7wBt7aNt1DBzE3WPbPQruhvo4x7Y95PBHnBMVaBLpump?timestamp=1790707500000","links":[{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/smolpeepee_x?s=11"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/egd4t9kqehgw9bdznpshdqwutjcxtj9h1jbxri6qpump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"EgD4T9kQEhgw9bDzNPShDQwutjcXTJ9h1JBxri6Qpump","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/_XrFVH_ujJftxOQR?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/6rmnce